{"id":"533aac05e72771cc","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-datalog.md","title":"有限关系 Datalog 与 Datalog* 的最小模型","display":"df-datalog — 有限关系 Datalog 与 Datalog* 的最小模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-datalog","aliases":["29-df-datalog"],"display":"df-datalog — 有限关系 Datalog 与 Datalog* 的最小模型","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Section 14.1.2; Query14.11; Proposition14.12, p.225, scan240","source_basis":"扫描240原图及文本层；显式给出有限规则、同时迭代及无头约束语义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-datalog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-datalog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-datalog — 有限关系 Datalog 与 Datalog* 的最小模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section 14.1.2; Query14.11; Proposition14.12, p.225, scan240"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描240原图及文本层；显式给出有限规则、同时迭代及无头约束语义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是有限关系词汇，可含常量、无函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle A_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,A_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle A_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,A_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 不交的新关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_j\\geq1\">\\(b_j\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>项、原子、赋值及项值分别使用所列上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),t^M[\\beta]\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),t^M[\\beta]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}\\)</span> 表示有限子集集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示有限序列集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,*\\}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\{+,*\\}\\)</span>；规则为头与有限体序列的有序对；体序列从0开始编号。符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是独立的无头约束标记，不是关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\">\\(M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\)</span> 保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的解释并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\">\\(A_j\\)</span> 的解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_j\">\\(X_j\\)</span>；其满足关系使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li>以下定义不额外施加语法范围限制；所有规则变量均在有限载体中取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})\">\\(\\mathbf X\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 属于下式给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^m\\{A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^{b_j}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^m\\{A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^{b_j}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B_+\\coloneqq\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\cup\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho},\\qquad\\mathsf B_*\\coloneqq\\mathsf B_+\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf B_+\\coloneqq\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\cup\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho},\\qquad\\mathsf B_*\\coloneqq\\mathsf B_+\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}\\bigl((\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\cup\\{\\bot\\})\\times\\mathsf B_\\epsilon^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}\\bigl((\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\cup\\{\\bot\\})\\times\\mathsf B_\\epsilon^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X))_j\\coloneqq X_j\\cup\\left\\{(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{b_j}^M[\\beta])\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;(A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j}),\\bar\\ell)\\in D,\\quad\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),\\\\&amp;\\forall h&lt;|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta]\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D\\in\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X))_j\\coloneqq X_j\\cup\\left\\{(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{b_j}^M[\\beta])\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;(A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j}),\\bar\\ell)\\in D,\\quad\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),\\\\&amp;\\forall h&lt;|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta]\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X^{D,M}_0\\coloneqq(\\varnothing)_{j=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{t+1}\\coloneqq T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_t),\\qquad N_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^m\\operatorname{card}(|M|)^{b_j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf X^{D,M}_0\\coloneqq(\\varnothing)_{j=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{t+1}\\coloneqq T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_t),\\qquad N_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^m\\operatorname{card}(|M|)^{b_j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\coloneqq\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{N_M},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,j}(M)\\coloneqq(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\coloneqq\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{N_M},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,j}(M)\\coloneqq(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OK}_D(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists(\\bot,\\bar\\ell)\\in D\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M)\\;\\forall h&lt;|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OK}_D(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists(\\bot,\\bar\\ell)\\in D\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M)\\;\\forall h&lt;|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\mathbf Y\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})\\;\\left(T_{D,M}(\\mathbf Y)=\\mathbf Y\\to\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j\\subseteq Y_j\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\mathbf Y\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})\\;\\left(T_{D,M}(\\mathbf Y)=\\mathbf Y\\to\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j\\subseteq Y_j\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书扫描240给出 Horn 规则的同时归纳语义；右端没有出现在头中的变量相当于存在量化，多条同头规则相当于析取。Datalog* 仅允许否定输入原子，不允许否定递归新关系。无头规则依原书脚注保留为独立约束检测；若 OK 为假则布尔查询失败，不能把它误当生成一个元组的规则。</p>\n<p>体中对所有递归关系均为正出现，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 单调且膨胀；从全空出发，严格增长一轮至少添加一个新元组，总共至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_M\">\\(N_M\\)</span> 个元组，故第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_M\">\\(N_M\\)</span> 轮稳定。对任何规则封闭族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf Y\">\\(\\mathbf Y\\)</span>，由归纳每轮均包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf Y\">\\(\\mathbf Y\\)</span>，从而得到最小性。这里按有限闭包计算语义，而不使用 Prolog 的递归调用搜索策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\epsilon\\in\\{+,*\\}$；规则为头与有限体序列的有序对；体序列从0开始编号。符号 $\\bot$ 是独立的无头约束标记，不是关系符号。$M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]$ 保留 $M$ 的解释并令 $A_j$ 的解释为 $X_j$；其满足关系使用 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\langle A_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,A_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"b_j\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau,\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),t^M[\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}","display":false},{"tex":"X^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\{+,*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"A_j","display":false},{"tex":"X_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf X\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\qquad\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^m\\{A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^{b_j}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf B_+\\coloneqq\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\cup\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho},\\qquad\\mathsf B_*\\coloneqq\\mathsf B_+\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{EAt}_\\tau\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}\\bigl((\\mathsf{IAt}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\cup\\{\\bot\\})\\times\\mathsf B_\\epsilon^{<\\omega}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathsf{Datalog}^{\\epsilon}_{\\tau,\\rho}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X))_j\\coloneqq X_j\\cup\\left\\{(t_1^M[\\beta],\\ldots,t_{b_j}^M[\\beta])\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&(A_j(t_1,\\ldots,t_{b_j}),\\bar\\ell)\\in D,\\quad\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M),\\\\&\\forall h<|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta]\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf X^{D,M}_0\\coloneqq(\\varnothing)_{j=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{t+1}\\coloneqq T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_t),\\qquad N_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^m\\operatorname{card}(|M|)^{b_j}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\coloneqq\\mathbf X^{D,M}_{N_M},\\qquad\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,j}(M)\\coloneqq(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OK}_D(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists(\\bot,\\bar\\ell)\\in D\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(M)\\;\\forall h<|\\bar\\ell|\\;M[\\rho:=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty]\\models\\ell_h[\\beta].","display":true},{"tex":"T_{D,M}(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)=\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\mathbf Y\\in\\prod_{j=1}^m\\mathcal P(|M|^{b_j})\\;\\left(T_{D,M}(\\mathbf Y)=\\mathbf Y\\to\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m(\\mathbf X^{D,M}_\\infty)_j\\subseteq Y_j\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"N_M","display":false},{"tex":"N_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf Y","display":false}],"bytes":3921,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-datalog]]、[[29-ex-datalog-tc]] — Datalog / Datalog* 最小模型及非空路径闭包"},{"id":"d20e58bb8f65e2eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}$ 使用 [[29-df-datalog]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$D_+$、$E^+$ 在下式构造。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-datalog]]"}],"outgoing":["28e86a5f0243a0ae","19d380b6c383f76b","ac5c4072279f0088","76bbac386a4be5a3","3ee556c64b16809b"]}